        <mxCell id="1_WY8IwRt--g009W-lap-21" value="&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Korath attack: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;FL gets a message (as long as they&#39;re in human space) about a pirate attack on [planet] and that their presence (and that of all Syndicate independent contractors) is required for the defense of [planet].&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;The other &#39;contractor&#39; defense ships should have mostly missile weapons&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;If this is still too risky with respect to giving FL access to an early jump drive, the vessel can even have a broken jump drive instead&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1230" y="1300" width="800" height="410" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
