        <mxCell id="1_WY8IwRt--g009W-lap-23" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Characters:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;1: Alien Scientist (initially only says that they&#39;re looking into if aliens exist) Elise Klamikonov&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;2. &#39;Mentor&#39;: &quot;Y&#39;know, the Syndicate is always looking for competent captains. You&#39;d get a lot out of officially signing on.&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;3. Syndicated Systems representative&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;4. Syndicated Shipyards representative&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;5. &quot;Agent Falco&quot;: a FW sympathizer (don&#39;t actually know if SYN FL will meet him, maybe to try and shake him down for the catalytic ramscoop tech)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;6. Marco Bugati: Syndicate Exec in charge of engineers who work with Korath tech&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;7. Zahir Gilmour: A miner who works near the Core and does some business with the Syndicate&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
