        <mxCell id="urCOEpVtA5ZqRUnClqoD-2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Exactly the FW reconciliation branch but with comments about how FL is representing the &#39;non-extreme&#39; SYN faction, how they&#39;re presence is a show of unity across human space, etc. &lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
