        <mxCell id="Dn4OLnnZR1lDdLMxqPTp-1" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;FL offered to formally join the Syndicate as an independent contractor&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;Salary: 1.5k&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;Syndicate License&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="100" y="1600" width="1040" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lITbNWXE8uC33C-zj884-14" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Deep and Clink (Kornephoros) become the FW border with the expanded pirate worlds. The FW Senate builds a large military station in the system that doubles as a waypoint for minerals from Clink and personnel on Deep. Twinstar receives a similar if less extreme makeover for similar reasons.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Trinket (Sargas) falls to pirates.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Sundrinker (Dschubba) falls to pirates.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Darkstone (Han) falls to pirates.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Lichen (Atria) falls to pirates.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Dancer (Rastaban) becomes the Republic cap on the expanded piracy of the South.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1060" y="3690" width="750" height="620" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
