        <mxCell id="9gBRIhDdBZ6MtFWvot8u-3" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 36px;&quot;&gt;10 &#39;Syndicate Missions&#39;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;(Is there a way to count jobs from a Syndicate Source? Or make some sort of &quot;Allegiance: Syndicate&quot; [which can then be mirrored with &quot;Allegiance: FW&quot; and &quot;Allegiance: Republic/Navy&quot;] )&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Also... Does this necessarily need to happen before the war? I don&#39;t really think so...&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
