        <mxCell id="H5OY3X-8F7X_Oy3o84kl-6" value="Escort freighters to different parts of the galaxy to help the Syndicate start selling at different outfitters and shipyards. Fight pirates." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
