        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="H5OY3X-8F7X_Oy3o84kl-7" value="&lt;div&gt;to offer: (some amount of combat rating)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;I&#39;m sort of imagining this like the Deep Black Box missions. FL escorts a freighter or two (to start) to various planets. Then there&#39;s some &#39;moment&#39; where &#39;it&#39;s time&#39; and instead of the Deep stuff, they now have to escort a substantial number of freighters to finalize the outfitter/shipyard setups. There can also be moments where NIMBY archetypes (who may or may not be justified since this is the Syndicate) argue against the &#39;colonization&#39;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;horizontal=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="8430" y="480" width="380" height="150" as="geometry" />
